OL,3,GNEWSAReform council leader quits after
OL,4,Astaff comments leaked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader of Leicestershire
OL,7,FCounty Council has announced he is
OL,8,Fstanding down after comments he made
OL,9,Fabout staff redundancies were leaked
OL,10,Fonline.
OL,12,FDan Harrison announced on Monday that
OL,13,Fhe would be stepping down from the role
OL,14,Fhe has held since May 2025.
OL,16,FHe said he had made the decision after
OL,17,Ftaking advice from senior Reform
OL,18,Fcolleagues, and added deputy council
OL,19,Fleader Kevin Crook had taken over as
OL,20,Facting leader.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
