OL,3,GNEWSAReform council leader quits after
OL,4,Astaff comments leaked
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Harrison had apologised
OL,7,Fafter being recorded saying 76
OL,8,F"incompetent" council solicitors would
OL,9,Fbe made redundant, before saying "what
OL,10,FI want to look at now is the women", in
OL,11,Fremarks which were then released on
OL,12,Fsocial media.
